# --- DE MINIMIS EXCLUSIONS (deliberately tier U, do not "fix") ----------------
# These carry an Etienne Cimon modification but the delta is too small to support
# relicensing the whole file. Measured against upstream a962460:
#   core/include/ariane_pkg.sv   +39/-7  in 806 lines (4.8%)  <- chokepoint file
#   corev_apu/clint/clint.sv      +8/-1  in 264 lines         <- clearly trivial
# Asserting CERN-OHL-S over ETH Zurich's work on this basis would be an
# overreach and is the weakest link in the reciprocity chain. Keep as tier U and
# keep the "Modified by" attribution. Re-audit if the delta grows past
# DE_MINIMIS_MIN_ADDED_LINES.
U   core/include/ariane_pkg.sv
U   corev_apu/clint/clint.sv

